===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|-elīn}}, {{m|gmh|-līn}}, from {{inh|de|goh|-ilī}}, {{m|goh|-ilīn}}.<ref>{{R:EWddS|ed=22|hw=-lein}}</ref> Cognate to {{cog|nl|-lijn}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/laɪ̯n/}}
